:protoc //third_party/grpc:grpc-java-plugin\r\n    cp bazel-bin/third_party/protobuf/3.0.0/protoc bazel-bin/third_party/grpc/grpc-java-plugin /tmp\r\n    export JAVA_VERSION=1.7\r\n    PROTOC=/tmp/protoc GRPC_JAVA_PLUGIN=/tmp/grpc-java-plugin ./compile.sh\r\n\r\nOn my machine, the classpath happens to contain the jars in this order:\r\nthird_party/guava/guava-21.0.jar\r\nthird_party/guava/guava-testlib-21.0-20161101.jar\r\nthird_party/guava/guava-testlib-21.0.jar\r\nthird_party/guava/guava-21.0-20161101.jar\r\n\r\nThe order is undefined, since we just call ```find third_party -name \"*.jar\"```. If we happen to get guava-21.0-20161101.jar before guava-21.0.jar, it'll probably work.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bazelbuild/bazel/issues/comments/284680423/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"ulfjack","id":7355745,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjczNTU3NDU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7355745?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ulfjack","html_url":"https://github.com/ulfjack","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ulfjack/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ulfjack/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ulfjack/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ulfjack/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ulfjack/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ulfjack/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ulfjack/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ulfjack/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ulfjack/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bazelbuild/bazel/issues/comments/284683914","html_url":"h